    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78ba0c277319d861bd18b044",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『超厉害的强壮药』……好像喝完之后，\r\n就会在体内诞生“白洞”的样子……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d6dfa141fe3145af3c138232fede6366de5eac7d6f8ebd8786d343bb71490eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
