    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b68a33243851e799f9c42aa7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让她发挥千分的精神，市面上贩售的药自然\r\n是不够的。而此时我们应该求助的对象是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac0adf7ffcaa01117dfb196101f22a84d7ed37c541afc6b085e0d2cf4d456658",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
