    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0fa8abe02ffa91d9f01945a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不知我们这一年究竟会遭遇什么……\r\n至少在此刻，让我们祈求神明的祝福吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b68935b4f7999718741cfb2840c76830169a17a9ef0cd37f89029bf99490b0d1",
